```

Do not mark this cell Track B. Track B is speech/definitions. Hours-on-a-legend is a posting record.

#### Object 3 — WORKING (Purpose, Decision, Plan, Verification, Latent state, Growth)

```markdown
# WORKING — [system name] — trail-legend-hours
## Purpose / target class
Target class: public-suite (drill)
Purpose: Determine whether the public trail-map legend lists winter hours.
## Decisions (append-only)
- [2026-09-08] Do not invent hours. Leave the cell open.
## Plan tasks
- [x] Write one card + one Open Cell
- [ ] Find the current legend PDF
## Verification
- Check: self-report “hours are probably posted”
- Evidence: none. No quote. No primary URL.
- Tri-state on the main claim: 0 / Unproven
- Frame Audit Gate 0: no
- Promote readiness: no
- Result: rejected. Status remains Unproven / Assumption.
## Latent state
- Locked decisions: do not invent hours
- Open gaps: current legend PDF not in hand
- Current focus: leave hole or find PDF
## Growth log
- Seed: Find the current legend PDF or leave the hole. Owner: coordinator. Date: 2026-09-08.
