### HONESTY BOX · THIS PACK

- **Truth status:** Human decision — this is a method brief, not a scored civic case.
- **Basis:** Evidence for the operating laws as written in the two source briefs; Inference that another careful person can rebuild from them.
- This pack describes the machinery. It is not a running install, not a 3D asset kit, and not a filled scoreboard. Software did not crown anything Supported. That a stranger will succeed from this pack is Inference, not Supported.

### Open holes (leave them open)

- No code tree ships with this brief. CLOUD mode still needs a repository the operator names.
- Globe is specified as rules, not as a bundled map engine or tileset, and only when the civic packet is on.
- Partner-country and polity stay variables until the operator names them.
- Scoreboard axes are empty by design. Filling them is a civic-packet act, not floor work.
- Visual smoke (LOCAL-BOX) is not included. Run it after the operator has seen once.
- Published trees change. The no-repo path (folder + three files + paste block) does not depend on a live clone.
- That a stranger will succeed is Inference. There is no independent rebuilder study in this pack.

### CLOSING LINE

Framework only. Your domain plugs in. Human still decides.

The system is implemented when the files exist, the first task has a verification cell, and another builder can continue. Until then it is only a conversation.

